msgstr "Could you connect me to the pharmacy? The one on duty. My grandson has a fever."

#: data/calls/transfer_01_dona_lurdes_farmacia_santa_rita.tres
msgid "A farmácia de plantão, moço. A que fica aberta de noite."
msgstr "The pharmacy on duty, young man. The one that's open at night."

